{"channelId":"UCFwJMBbONVnfdFhghwDvpLA","row":["Dr. Giselle Tadros - Milk Matters",937,"Hi! I’m Dr. Gigi, I’m a pediatric physical therapist and oral motor specialist dedicated to: \n\n👶 Helping children with tongue and lip ties thrive\n🤱 Educating parents and medical professionals on tongue ties and why physical therapy can be so helpful\n🍼 Offering clinical excellence to patients by incorporating scientifically backed treatments with an emphasis on a whole-body approach. \n\nI’m blessed with an incredible team of experienced pediatric therapists who love working with babies and are their biggest cheerleaders. \n\nTogether, we’ve created a beautiful community where parents feel seen, heard and safe. \n\nMost importantly, we’ve helped thousands of babies thrive without tear-jerking therapy providing fun, low-stress and brain-building therapy for infants.\n\n📅 Schedule a consultation: https://www.milkmatterspt.com/","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFwJMBbONVnfdFhghwDvpLA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFwJMBbONVnfdFhghwDvpLA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:34.561Z","channelId":"UCFwJMBbONVnfdFhghwDvpLA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d639a58f7b2d4602a8e26318bebbf156698c2c4f7ca452e9fa630ff5d8a4255e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"0b590e0dc63ac11ea7f0116074293bd521e5368dd82846f4404dbada0c99b1e1"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFwJMBbONVnfdFhghwDvpLA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:34.561Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFwJMBbONVnfdFhghwDvpLA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":937,"raw":"937 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFwJMBbONVnfdFhghwDvpLA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:34.561Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["physical therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["physical therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[